Package: HistoneMod
Type: Package
Title: Quantification of Histone Post-Translational Modifications
Version: 0.6.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jie", "Hua", email = "jie.Hua@bmc.med.lmu.de", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Marco", "Borso", role = "ctb"),
    person("Beyza", "Bozdag", role = "ctb"),
    person("Axel", "Imhof", role = "ths")
    )
Description: Provides an installable Shiny application for quantitative
    analysis of histone post-translational modifications from Skyline-like
    peptide-level CSV exports. The package validates input tables, computes
    relative peptide abundances, and offers interactive PCA, heatmap, barplot,
    data export, and quick PDF report workflows.
